      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi siida Yahudi gaburda naaha? Ama ghasmeahooda gwarachi naaha? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaburda muuchi aba naweadinga sean. Aba madeeda fuga Yahudi siitaw ng'asheega gasa ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gay gawuurjiin abeeda ii mamwasa fuga mwaatkwa? Nyoota masaweega nyaawa gay ghoamu ghwayam doobiiwnata ASEETA? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manda! ASEETA ea doabiiwaat galeagasean earapeadi bea ng'uya buuneesean. Gawuurji ginyaashta ng'ooruutka,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Manda siida doabiiwaat",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi gajeayeanaan? Aseasa fuga Yahudi geewooschi miyaasiin muuchi? Manda, eara gili mwanang'. Aba gideaba sisikteawi aseasa gideaba buuneesean, fuga Yahudi ea fuga Yunani, eara saawa gwanda jeeda uurda riing'eeda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gawuurji gissing'oarda;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi sinali gideaba ng'asheega sean rugu deaweeda gwarukuna badahuuka fuga mida jeeda deaweeda, ak abeeda gearat ghuusiga sean, ak gawa ng'eanyiisean jeeda girgweageeda ASEETA; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ea manda siida jea ghwanyas doobiiwnata aba madeadaanyi aba gadiyoojiga deaweeda, nea aba deaweeda iissa geanyas fughareeda riing'eeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gidagooniidaneasa ASEETA doobiiwnata",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghamneawa doobiiwnata ASEETA ea nidaajiit nea manda deaweeda, aba gideaba sibanga ea deaweeda gamuuwu ng'asheesu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ea doobiiwnata ASEETA gil, aba naweeda masaweega mida jeeda Yesu Gristo aba heeda buuneesean mideawa masaweega. Aba gideaba maheeli; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideaba nisin buuneesean riing'eeda, ak ghwasuunyeawa giigheambiita ASEETA, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iissa geataw doobiiwnata mwadaagha aba dagheerjeanduumeadaanyi, aba naweedida bea lealeanooda mida heeda Gristo Yesuun; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea niny ghayi ea ninung' ASEETA ghoah siida jea goohuun buuneeda, aba foojeandaanyi, ak geanyas aba masaweega. Ak abeeda ghoahiimu doobiiwnataanyi ak gwasindunu nea gagasa ghoahiimu gideaba niny ea doabiiwaat ak ghwanung'waada ASEETA riing'eega ghayi siisheeda eesin; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ghoadaajiit aba damani gideaba niny ea doabiiwaat ea gideaba gaygoomajeek siida mideawa masaweega aba jeeda Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi gwandeenu ghwaroadeaba geaw? Sirassa jarooda. Aba deaweedeeda uurjiin? Aba deaweedeeda jea eesini? Manda! Geaghus deaweedeeda mideawa masaweega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi sidaayi gideaba siida iissa ghwanyas doobiiwnata aba masaweega nea meakna sinooda deaweeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama ASEETA niny ASEETA fuga Yahudi gil ak ghwahidi? Niny mii ASEETA Eemoojiga seani? Huumwa, niny ASEETA Eemoojiga seani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba huumwa ASEETA iiyagi, nea dea jea ghoadaw doobiiwnata fugiga siyaat ghasmeahooda aba masaweegean abeeda gay ghoadaw doobiiwnata eara fugiga mii gaweay ghasmeahoodean aba masaweega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda gajeayamwa deaweeda aba masaweegiga? Manda! Iisiyam abeeda geemmajeekchi deaweeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
